---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: One change of the accounts at a time
    accDescr: A tap on a player, a second tap on the same player and the renewal in the background wait in one queue of the service worker. Each turn loads the saved accounts, talks to Autodarts and the page, and saves before the next turn starts, so the second tap finds the player playing and spends no token.

    tap["A tap on Bob"]
    again["A second tap on Bob"]
    renewal["The renewal in the background<br>one turn per parked account"]
    queue["The queue of the service worker<br>one change at a time"]
    tap --> queue
    again --> queue
    renewal --> queue

    subgraph turn ["Each turn"]
        direction TB
        load["Load the saved accounts"]
        work["Renew the token at Autodarts<br>and write it into the page"]
        save["Save the accounts"]
        load --> work --> save
    end

    queue --> load
    save --> next["The next turn starts<br>the second tap finds Bob playing<br>and spends no token"]

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class queue bot
    class next done
